From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: own multicast policy and membership lifetimes

Parse bounded reports and serialize VLAN/source-filter membership generations.
Keep host state, pending messages, applied firmware groups and descriptor pins
alive until their actual owners retire; quarantine uncertain transport.

This is the final native integration against the pinned vendor source.
Firmware-dependent policy remains downstream with exact image admission.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

